<title>UK: Sullom Voe Brent liftings rise, US sailings steady. [CORRECTED 18:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe Brent liftings rise, US sailings steady. [CORRECTED 18:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loadings of Brent crude from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal totalled 773,446 tonnes (Corrects from 704,215 tonnes) in the week to November 11, up from 762,735 tonnes the previous week, the Shetland Islands Council Marine Operations Department said.</p>
<p>The shipments were split almost evenly between European and U.S. destinations.</p>
